      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Behavior\n\n## Implemented behavior\n\nScriptNode and the scripting subsystem manage source/run/result transport. usePluginRuntime dispatches API calls with host checks. Raw script cards are hidden in browse mode unless class-backed and explicitly browser-presented. A script may be executable without a visible card.\n\n## Known gaps\n\nThe full host API is implementation-defined in usePluginRuntime and is not summarized as unrestricted read/write access. Method effects enforcement covers a narrower subset than the declared vocabulary; see Method. Do not treat visibility or dryRun alone as a complete security boundary.\n\n## Open decisions\n\nNo additional decision is required to describe the behavior above. Changes to that contract require an explicit task; implementation gaps are not implied approvals.\n\n## Evidence\n\nSource (twilite repository):\n- `components/GraphEditor/Nodes/ScriptNode.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/Scripting/scriptRefLoader.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/Scripting/scriptSourceTransport.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/hooks/usePluginRuntime.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/nodeVisibilityRoles.js`\n\nFocused tests (twilite repository):\n- `tests/scriptRefLoader.test.js`\n- `tests/scriptSourceTransport.test.js`\n- `tests/nodeVisibilityRoles.test.js`\n\nThese pointers identify evidence to inspect. Structural validation does not prove runtime or browser behavior."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-script",
          "nodeId": "script-behavior"
        }
      }
    },
